window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/qpu-v25-012-7acc1a26b3832571.json"]={sha256:"7acc1a26b38325718d9083d4eb4a351adca3105f4496b675b4745e234cae9cd4",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v25-case-fa072594f97a0cba","url":"https://www.rigetti.com/research/modular-superconducting-qubit-architecture-with-a-multi-chip-tunable-coupler","title":"Modular superconducting qubit architecture with a multi-chip tunable coupler","titleEn":"Modular superconducting qubit architecture with a multi-chip tunable coupler","publisher":"Rigetti Computing","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"qpu-v25-012","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"qpu-v25-012","related":[{"id":"qpu-v25-013","referenceUrls":["https://doi.org/10.1103/PRXQuantum.2.040204"],"title":"超導讀出共振器：Q 值與線寬","titleEn":"Superconducting readout resonator: quality factor and linewidth","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：逐項標記通過、失敗或資料不足，不以熟悉品牌代替證據。最終交接必須包括：交付分段乘積／對數帳、介面診斷樹與相干測試缺口。 所有通過結論只在本課明列假設內成立。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Mark each item pass, fail or insufficient evidence; a familiar brand is not proof. Final handover must include: Deliver product/log loss accounting, an interface fault tree and missing coherence tests. Every pass remains conditional on the stated teaching assumptions.","difference":"建立『超導讀出共振器：Q 值與線寬』可核算的名義與變更模型，區分實際來源背景、合成輸入及驗收證據。成果：交付功率頻譜、Q反算與內外損耗區分表。","differenceEn":"Build reproducible nominal and changed models for 'Superconducting readout resonator: quality factor and linewidth', separating sourced context, synthetic inputs and acceptance evidence. Outcome: Deliver power spectra, inverse Q and an internal/external loss distinction table.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["先從模型逐項推導，標記量綱與近似：獨立損失的生存概率相乘η總=η1η2η3；只計人口損失，不把它當完整量子通道保真度。 使用合成發送η1=0.98、線路η2=0.97、接收η3=0.98。 以手算或試算表計算名義式0.98*0.97*0.98，另開一欄執行獨立核對：用−lnη把各段損失改為相加，再取exp還原；確認沒有將概率直接相加。","先從模型逐項推導，標記量綱與近似：載入Q=f0/Δf；Δf為功率半高全寬。不能把振幅半高寬或角頻率混用。 使用合成f0=6 GHz、Q=10000；頻寬以MHz表示。 以手算或試算表計算名義式6e9/10000/1e6，另開一欄執行獨立核對：由兩個半功率頻點相減得到Δf，再反算Q；檢查掃頻解析度至少小於0.06 MHz。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Derive each term, marking dimensions and approximations: Independent survival factors multiply ηtotal=η1η2η3; population survival is not full quantum-channel fidelity. Use Synthetic launchη1=0.98, lineη2=0.97 and receiveη3=0.98. Evaluate nominal expression 0.98*0.97*0.98 by hand or spreadsheet, then independently check: Convert each loss using−lnη, add and exponentiate back; verify probabilities were not added directly.","Derive each term, marking dimensions and approximations: Loaded Q=f0/Δf with power full width at half maximum; do not substitute amplitude half-height width or angular frequency. Use Synthetic f0=6 GHz and Q=10000; express bandwidth in MHz. Evaluate nominal expression 6e9/10000/1e6 by hand or spreadsheet, then independently check: Subtract half-power frequencies to obtain Δf and invert Q; require sweep resolution below0.06 MHz.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"qpu-v25-022","referenceUrls":["https://www.ibm.com/quantum/blog/modular-cryogenics"],"title":"IBM 模組冷凍機：配線傳導與熱錨","titleEn":"IBM modular cryostat: wire conduction and thermal anchoring","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：逐項標記通過、失敗或資料不足，不以熟悉品牌代替證據。最終交接必須包括：交付分段乘積／對數帳、介面診斷樹與相干測試缺口。 所有通過結論只在本課明列假設內成立。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Mark each item pass, fail or insufficient evidence; a familiar brand is not proof. Final handover must include: Deliver product/log loss accounting, an interface fault tree and missing coherence tests. Every pass remains conditional on the stated teaching assumptions.","difference":"建立『IBM 模組冷凍機：配線傳導與熱錨』可核算的名義與變更模型，區分實際來源背景、合成輸入及驗收證據。成果：交付單線／束線熱表、錨點剖面與k(T)資料需求。","differenceEn":"Build reproducible nominal and changed models for 'IBM modular cryostat: wire conduction and thermal anchoring', separating sourced context, synthetic inputs and acceptance evidence. Outcome: Deliver wire/bundle heat tables, anchor cross-sections and required k(T) data.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["先從模型逐項推導，標記量綱與近似：獨立損失的生存概率相乘η總=η1η2η3；只計人口損失，不把它當完整量子通道保真度。 使用合成發送η1=0.98、線路η2=0.97、接收η3=0.98。 以手算或試算表計算名義式0.98*0.97*0.98，另開一欄執行獨立核對：用−lnη把各段損失改為相加，再取exp還原；確認沒有將概率直接相加。","先從模型逐項推導，標記量綱與近似：常數平均導熱率代理Q=kAΔT/L；真實低溫材料需積分k(T)，此處只做尺寸敏感度。 使用合成平均k=0.02 W/(m·K)、A=10⁻⁸ m²、ΔT=3.9 K、L=0.2 m。 以手算或試算表計算名義式0.02*1e-8*3.9/0.2*1e6，另開一欄執行獨立核對：核對Q×L不變；再將100根相同配線加總，避免把單根結果誤當整束。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Derive each term, marking dimensions and approximations: Independent survival factors multiply ηtotal=η1η2η3; population survival is not full quantum-channel fidelity. Use Synthetic launchη1=0.98, lineη2=0.97 and receiveη3=0.98. Evaluate nominal expression 0.98*0.97*0.98 by hand or spreadsheet, then independently check: Convert each loss using−lnη, add and exponentiate back; verify probabilities were not added directly.","Derive each term, marking dimensions and approximations: Constant mean-conductivity proxy Q=kAΔT/L; real cryogenic materials require integrating k(T), so this exercise only studies geometric sensitivity. Use Synthetic mean k=0.02 W/(m·K), A=10⁻⁸ m², ΔT=3.9 K and L=0.2 m. Evaluate nominal expression 0.02*1e-8*3.9/0.2*1e6 by hand or spreadsheet, then independently check: Verify invariant Q×L; sum100 identical wires separately so per-wire heat is not mistaken for bundle heat.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v25-case-a3054099b553bbb6","url":"https://doi.org/10.1103/PRXQuantum.2.040204","title":"Superconducting Circuit Companion—an Introduction with Worked Examples","titleEn":"Superconducting Circuit Companion—an Introduction with Worked Examples","publisher":"Rasmussen et al., PRX Quantum","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v25-case-e7862bd663cd03b1","url":"https://www.ibm.com/quantum/blog/modular-cryogenics","title":"IBM’s new modular architecture for cryogenic systems","titleEn":"IBM’s new modular architecture for cryogenic systems","publisher":"IBM Quantum","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
